OL,3,GNEWSARape retrial for Kosovan soldier
OL,4,Ais dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retrial of a Kosovan soldier accused
OL,7,Fof raping a woman in Norfolk has been
OL,8,Fdropped after the Crown Prosecution
OL,9,FService (CPS) said it would not be
OL,10,Foffering any evidence.
OL,12,FIn May, the jury at Norwich Crown Court
OL,13,Ffailed to reach a verdict on a rape
OL,14,Fcharge against Bali Hoxha, 29, who
OL,15,Fdenied attacking a woman in Norwich
OL,16,Fcity centre on 17 September 2025 and
OL,17,Fhad argued that any sexual contact had
OL,18,Fbeen consensual.
OL,20,FDuring that trial he was found not
OL,21,Fguilty of two counts of sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
